  "description": "Embedded, in-process, typed-property hypergraph kernel for C#, purpose-fit for\n      long-lived adaptive symbolic memory workloads (AI/agent memory). Four-primitive storage\n      contract (Handle/Vertex/Incidence/PropertyKey<T>), ~40 default-implemented traversal\n      and analytics algorithms (BFS/DFS/shortest-path/cycle/SCC/s-walk/community detection/\n      centrality/PageRank), reification, composable views, embeddings, and learnable edges\n      (M0-M6, M11 phase 1).",
